    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tThe Music of Star Wars\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19 January 2019 @ 2:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t“A long time ago in a galaxy far, far away…”\nFeel the force around you and be transported to a galaxy far, far away with music from Star Wars and other iconic sci-fi moves including Star Trek, Battlestar Galactica and more.  Re-live Darth Vader’s Imperial March, the main title sequence and other quintessential Star Wars moments live with the VS under the exciting baton of our Principal Pops Conductor Sean O’Loughlin.\nTickets are $31 – $86 and are available here.\n \n \n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t 19 January 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstarts at 2:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Pops Series\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t http://www.rmts.bc.ca/events/pops-4-2019-royal-theatre \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t  \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMin Plays Schumann\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            Concert Credits\n            Sean O’LoughlinconductorVox Humana Chamber Choir\n\n            Concert Programme\n            Newman20th Century FanfareWilliamsStar Wars: Main TitlePhillips/LarsonTheme from Battlestar GalacticaSafanThe Last Starfighter Overturearr. CusterStar Trek Through the YearsGiancchinoStar TrekHornerAvatar SuiteWilliamsDuel of the Fates: Episode IWilliamsAcross the Stars: Episode IIWilliamsBattle of the Heroes: Episode IIIWilliamsPrincess Leia's Theme: Episode IVWilliamsImperial March: Episode VWilliamsYoda's Theme: Episode VWilliams (arr. O'Loughlin)The Force Awakens Suite: Episode VIIWilliamsThe Rebellion is Born: Episode VIII\n\n            Supporters\n            \n\n            \n            Buy Tickets\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« A Viennese New Year’s\n\t\t\tBig Bongo »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
      },
