    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tOld Blue Eyes: The Music of Frank Sinatra\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t2 November 2019 @ 8:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescribed by the New York Times as “two parts young Sinatra to one part Billy Joel”, Tony DeSare joins the VS to sing hits from legendary Old Blue Eyes himself, Frank Sinatra. Luck Be A Lady, Come Fly With Me and My Way are just a few of Sinatra’s hits this sultry crooner and his grooving band will perform.\nTickets are $33 – $85. Click here to buy tickets!\nJoin concert sponsor Revera for a pre-concert tea on Sunday, starting @ 1:00 pm in the lobby!\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t 2 November 2019 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstarts at 8:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Pops Series\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t  \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMin Plays Schumann\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            Concert Credits\n            Giuseppe PietraroiaconductorTony DeSareentertainer\n\n            Supporters\n            \n\n            \n            Buy Tickets\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Haydn & Beethoven\n\t\t\tOld Blue Eyes: The Music of Frank Sinatra »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
      },
