      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Christian Kluxen, conductor Schubert, Symphony No. 9 in C major (The Great) For his long-awaited return, VS Music Director, Christian Kluxen leads Franz Schubert’s Symphony No. 9 in C major....&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
