    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Holly Mathieson returns to travel through musical space and time. In the wake of his marriage to Clara Wieck, music poured out of Schumann’s pen, including the three “symphonic” gems...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
