    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Trading bouquets of mutual admiration and professional support, Schumann lent his discerning ear to the ‘dreamy’ incidental music written by his close friend Mendelssohn—the first person to conduct Schumann’s “Spring”...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
