        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Victoria Symphony teams up with the Greater Vic­toria Youth Orchestra in a special joint performance sure to inspire. Enescu’s work sets the stage in a stately and supremely lyrical manner...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
