    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;London-born conductor Leo McFall explores a lineage of musical camaraderie connecting Robert and Clara Schumann to Brahms, and onward to Dvořák. Featuring the drama and romance of Schumann’s only opera...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
