    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Associate Conductor Giuseppe Pietraroia evokes the sights and sounds of Italy, as captured by Felix Mendelssohn in a musical postcard brimming with Neapolitan flavour! Respighi serves up ‘old wine in...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
