    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A signature musical event of the summer! The VS Orchestra, led by Associate Conductor Giuseppe Pietraroia performs at the beautiful Butchart Gardens alongside soprano Lucia Cesaroni, baritone Justin Welsh, and...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
