        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The Victoria Symphony presents the Pacific Baroque Orchestra’s production of Monteverdi\\'s Vespers. Claudio Monteverdi’s Vespers of 1610 is an undisputed masterpiece of spiritual and emotional depth, at times intimate and...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
