      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;THIS CONCERT IS SOLD OUT. The extraordinary cellist, globe-trotting teacher, and humanitarian Yo-Yo Ma returns to the Royal Theatre to perform with your Victoria Symphony. As the peak of our...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
