    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Another Op’nin’, Another Show! VS lights up the Royal Theatre with some of the best and brightest hits of Broadway from The Sound of Music, Les Misérables, My Fair Lady, Phantom...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
