    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;From the deceptively simple to disguised genius, these works from different eras connect in intriguing ways. Ligeti’s Austro-Hungarian roots link the Vienna of old with the micro-melodic modern day. Mozart’s...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
