        "@value": "Kluxen – Mozart &#038; Bartók"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Two musical giants converge in a program that touches on music of the night. In modern parlance, Mozart’s Gran Partita could be subtitled “My Big Fat Viennese Wind Symphony.” Its rich sonority...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
