        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The product of a summer’s holiday in 1883, Brahms’s Third Symphony has been described as being “…artistically the most perfect.” A single movement from Mahler’s Symphony No. 3 was the inspiration for...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
