        "@value": "Beethoven Symphony No. 5"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;﻿A fateful quote from The Iliad inspired Beethoven, and the American composer Carlos Simon. Is it fate, “knocking at the door” that their works should be featured on the same program? Like...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
