    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A true holiday favourite, this beloved comedy classic features renowned composer John Williams’ charming and delightful score performed live to picture by the Victoria Symphony. Macaulay Culkin stars as Kevin...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
