        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Maestro Giuseppe Pietraroia and your Victoria Symphony are coming to Sidney with music for The Most Wonderful Time of the Year! From holiday classics to spirited renditions of favourite carols,...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
