    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Christmas Time is Here and Canadian Brass is back in Victoria with music for The Most Wonderful Time of the Year! From holiday classics to jazzy renditions of favourite carols, the world famous...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
