        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Maestro Giuseppe Pietraroia, Sidney-born soprano Diane Pancel, and the Victoria Symphony are coming to Qualicum Beach with music for The Most Wonderful Time of the Year! From holiday classics to...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
