      {
        "@value": "A New Year&#8217;s Day Celebration"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Victoria’s favourite New Year’s tradition! Effervescent soprano Tracy Dahl hits the high notes as VS breaks out the bubbly. Revel in a musical banquet of much-loved arias, choruses, glamorous dances,...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
