    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;In advance of Valentine’s Day, we share three heart-felt musical depictions of love: the tragedy of Shakespeare’s star-crossed lovers from the pen of Tchaikovsky; Saint-Saëns’ romantic, poetic musings in an...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
