    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;THIS CONCERT IS SOLD OUT. We share some views of our beautiful blue planet, blending live music with Science &amp; Symphony’s high-definition films alongside Dr. José Francisco Salgado’s explorations of...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
