    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Join us for an evening of classical charm and lyrical beauty at Victoria\\'s majestic Christ Church Cathedral! Led by Maestro Giuseppe Pietraroia, the evening opens with Mozart’s Overture to The...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
