        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A signature musical event of the summer! Led by Maestro Giuseppe Pietraroia, Principal Conductor of Pacific Opera Victoria, the Victoria Symphony performs at The Butchart Gardens alongside soprano Lauren Margison,...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
