        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;With “a voice like a beacon of hope” (Seattle Times), vocalist Jimmie Herrod earned the rare “Golden Buzzer” recognition on America’s Got Talent in 2021. With a globe-trotting career as...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
