    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tWhat Do YOU Play?\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t18 October 2025 @ 3:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBuy Tickets\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSome people play soccer, others play video games. For many of us, what we love to play is our musical instruments! Known for his fun and engaging kids concerts, conductor and host Vern Griffiths will lead us on an exploration of different musical instruments, including some that you don’t often find in a symphony. What do YOU play?\nNot included in subscription purchase discount.  Tickets available to purchase through the UVic Ticket Centre starting Tuesday, July 22, 2025.\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n    \n    Meet the ArtistsFull Concert Program\n    \n    \n        \n    \n        Vern Griffiths, conductor\nPercussionist and conductor Vern Griffiths is the Principal Percussionist of the Vancouver Symphony. He is also known for writing fun and engaging kids concerts, and his hit show Wall to Wall Percussion has been performed over 60 times across Canada (and recently into the US), with the symphonies of Victoria, Vancouver, Calgary, Edmonton, Winnipeg, Lima (OH), and Toronto. He has performed Wall to Wall Percussion 10 times with the Victoria Symphony!\nHis second kids show, The Composer Is Here, explores in a fun and participatory way the creative act of writing music. We’ll meet and hear music by several local composers, ranging from wily veterans to emerging students, and also learn about composers like Mozart, Tchaikovsky, and John Williams. The climax is when the audience and Vern will write a melody together — live, onstage — and then sing this new piece together with the Victoria Symphony!\nOtherwise, Vern is a musician wearing many hats. Aside from playing with the Vancouver Symphony, he is also a member of the award-winning new music ensemble Standing Wave, has recorded movie soundtracks for Disney, ABC, IMAX, NFB, EA Sports, and Dreamworks. He has been teaching percussion at the UBC School of Music since 1997. Vern is also a composer, and recently had two of his works recorded by the Vancouver Symphony.\nAs a conductor, he has led pops shows featuring stars like Stewart Copeland and Holly Cole, as well as other kid’s concerts and quite a bit of contemporary music. He has a particular interest in working with contemporary Canadian composers, and has conducted works by Jocelyn Morlock, Rodney Sharman, Alfredo Santa Ana, Dorothy Chang, John Estacio, Anna Höstman, Nico Muhly, Rita Ueda, Andrea Tarrodi, Laura Pettigrew, and Marcus Goddard. His third kids concert, called What Do YOU Play?, debuted with the Vancouver Symphony in May of 2024.\nJiaqi Zhang, erhu\nJiaqi Zhang has over 10 years of musical experience with the erhu and continues to share her passion for Chinese music through both solo and group performances. She is currently a student at the University of British Columbia, and enjoys exploring other instruments and has various accomplishments in other musical styles.\n\n    \n\n    \n        Concert program to come.\n\n    \n\n    \n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t 18 October 2025 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstarts at 3:00 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Kids at the Farquhar\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t Farquhar at UVic \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\nUniversity Farquhar Auditorium, Ring Road\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVictoria,\n\n\tBC\n\n\tV8P 5C2\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone\n\t\t\t\t\t 250.721.8480 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            Concert Credits\n            VERN GRIFFITHSconductorJIAQI ZHANGerhuGORDY BEARIndigenous drummer\n\n            Supporters\n            Robert & Devi Jawl Foundation\nSeason UnderwriterEgon Baumann Music Foundation\nKids at the Farquhar Series Underwriter\n\n            \n            Buy Tickets\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Dvořák Symphony No. 7\n\t\t\tVS Presents: Valdés, Goodyear, & VIS »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
      },
