    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;“Hallelujah!” In 1741, Handel composed his great oratorio Messiah in just three weeks, and its message continues to reign forever and ever, enthralling audiences annually. Victoria’s magnificent Christ Church Cathedral...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
