    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Follow the exploits of the charming, arrogant title character Peer Gynt, a Norwegian peasant who travels the world in search of his true self. Theatre Director Antony Ernst condenses Ibsen’s monumental story...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
