    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Travel through the trees and across the seas with Maestro Mouse and the Victoria Symphony for New York Times best-selling author Dan Brown’s Wild Symphony, where you’ll meet a big...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
