        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Mahler’s Fifth Symphony is undoubtedly his most famous work, and it contains echoes of some of the greatest highs and lows of his life. After surviving a near fatal haemorrhage in 1901,...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
