    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;An evening featuring hits made famous by the reigning divas of Soul and R&amp;B: Aretha Franklin, Tina Turner, Patti LaBelle, Gladys Knight, Whitney Houston, Amy Winehouse, Alicia Keys, and Adele....&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
