    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The misty and melancholy atmosphere of Edinburgh’s Holyrood Palace provided the initial inspiration for Mendelssohn’s “Scottish” Symphony. Its triumphant finale parallels the conclusion of Beethoven’s Egmont – a tragedy that ends in victory. The...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
