        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Enter the enchanting worlds of Studio Ghibli through the magical music of Joe Hisaishi, the composer behind their most beloved animated films. This tribute concert journeys through the nostalgic melodies...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
