    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tSpirited Away – The Music of Studio Ghibli\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tNovember 1 @ 2:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEnter the enchanting worlds of Studio Ghibli through the magical music of Joe Hisaishi, the composer behind their most beloved animated films. This tribute concert journeys through the nostalgic melodies of My Neighbor Totoro, the lyrical flights of Spirited Away, and the epic rhythms of Kiki’s Delivery Service. Each note opens a doorway to wonder, capturing the imagination and heart of every listener—an unforgettable experience for audiences of all ages.\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n    \n    Meet the Artists\n    \n    \n        \n    \n        \nJuliane Gallant, conductor\nNew Brunswick–born conductor Juliane Gallant is Resident Conductor and Artistic Advisor, Pops, of the Calgary Philharmonic Orchestra. A dynamic and versatile artist, she has collaborated with a wide range of performers including Steven Page, The Tenors, Chantal Kreviazuk, Kiesza, Serena Ryder, and Brett Kissel. She has appeared as a guest conductor with the Boston Pops, National Arts Centre Orchestra, Victoria Symphony, and orchestras across Canada. \nA passionate collaborator, Gallant began her career as a pianist, répétiteur, and vocal coach before moving into conducting. She established a strong presence in opera in the UK, leading productions with companies including Gothic Opera, Hampstead Garden Opera, and Opera Upclose. In 2021, she made her Royal Opera House debut conducting Mami Wata in collaboration with Pegasus Opera. In Canada, she has served as Music Director for Eugene Onegin at Highlands Opera Studio and conducted Nicole Lizée’s R.U.R. A Torrent of Light with Tapestry Opera. She made her United States debut in 2025 with Opera Saratoga. \nGallant is a graduate of the National Opera Studio, Guildhall School of Music and Drama, and leading Canadian institutions. She was a conducting fellow with Tapestry Opera’s Women in Musical Leadership program and has received support from the Royal Opera House, Canada Council for the Arts, and other major arts organizations.\n\n    \n\n    \n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tAdd to calendar\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tDate:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t November 1 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tTime:\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstarts at 2:30 pm\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Pops at the Royal\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\t\t Royal Theatre \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n805 Broughton St\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone\n\t\t\t\t\t 250.386.6121 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            Concert Credits\n            JULIANE GALLANTconductor\n\n            Concert Programme\n            Joe HisashiSymphonic Variation \"Merry-Go-Round\" from How's Moving CastleJoe HisashiOrchestra Stories: My Neighbor TotoroJoe Hisashi\"A Town with an Ocean View\" from Kiki's Delivery ServiceJoe HisashiDeparturesJoe HisashiSpirited Away Suite\n\n            Supporters\n            Terry Scandrett & Angela Bassage\nSeason UnderwritersRobert & Devi Jawl Foundation\nPops at the Royal Series UnderwriterA & A King Family Foundation\nConcert Underwriter\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Spirited Away – The Music of Studio Ghibli\n\t\t\tSeason Special: Kluxen – Ray Chen Plays Mendelssohn »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
      },
      {
        "@value": "\n\n\n.flex_column.av-3bwh-fc85a338ae3b6814fa82a53834137db1{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n\n\n#top .av-special-heading.av-kntf8k8t-ff4b8e8a5d9c2a3a0a59ed25208fd815{\npadding-bottom:10px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-kntf8k8t-ff4b8e8a5d9c2a3a0a59ed25208fd815 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-kntf8k8t-ff4b8e8a5d9c2a3a0a59ed25208fd815 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\ne-Notes\n\n                \n                        \n                            Join our Newsletter\n                         \n \n                        X/TwitterThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.Name*Email*\n                            \n                        \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n            \n        \n                        \n                        \n/* <![CDATA[ */\n gform.initializeOnLoaded( function() {gformInitSpinner( 1, 'https://victoriasymphony.ca/wp-content/plugins/gravityforms/images/spinner.svg', true );jQuery('#gform_ajax_frame_1').on('load',function(){var contents = jQuery(this).contents().find('*').html();var is_postback = contents.indexOf('GF_AJAX_POSTBACK') >= 0;if(!is_postback){return;}var form_content = jQuery(this).contents().find('#gform_wrapper_1');var is_confirmation = jQuery(this).contents().find('#gform_confirmation_wrapper_1').length > 0;var is_redirect = contents.indexOf('gformRedirect(){') >= 0;var is_form = form_content.length > 0 && ! is_redirect && ! is_confirmation;var mt = parseInt(jQuery('html').css('margin-top'), 10) + parseInt(jQuery('body').css('margin-top'), 10) + 100;if(is_form){jQuery('#gform_wrapper_1').html(form_content.html());if(form_content.hasClass('gform_validation_error')){jQuery('#gform_wrapper_1').addClass('gform_validation_error');} else {jQuery('#