    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;VS transforms the Royal Theatre into a gallery of musical paintings under guest conductor Maurice Cohn. Jocelyn Morlock’s Oiseaux bleus et sauvages captures the exuberance of wild birds in flight; pianist Élisabeth...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
