        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Bach’s Mass in B minor stands as one of the greatest summations of his genius. Vancouver Symphony Orchestra Music Director Otto Tausk leads the VS, Vancouver Chamber Choir, and five...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
