    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Canadian composer Jacques Hétu’s Légendes weaves three Québec folk tales into devilishly clever orchestral storytelling, rich in colour and dramatic flair. Richard Strauss’s Concertino for Clarinet and Bassoon offers a rare and...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
