    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The VS presents Star Wars: A New Hope in Concert featuring a screening of the complete film with composer John Williams’ iconic Oscar®-winning score performed live to the film. A young farm...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
