    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Treat yourself, family, and friends to this musical toast as VS rings in 2026! Overtures, arias, choruses, and dances will thrill while the soprano voice of Claire de Sévigné will sparkle like a fine champagne in this most favourite New Year’s Day tradition – which has sold out two years in a row!&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
