    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;VS returns to Qualicum Beach for an evening of classical charm and lyrical beauty! Led by Maestro Giuseppe Pietraroia, the evening opens with Mozart’s Overture to The Magic Flute, a brilliant prelude to one of his final and most beloved operas. VS Principal Trumpet Ryan Cole takes the spotlight in Neruda\\'s Trumpet Concerto in E-flat...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
