      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;They say Latin America’s greatest contribution to the world is joy. Sal Ferreras’ Latin Jazz Sextet with vocalist Adonis Puentes join forces with the Victoria Symphony for an unforgettable evening! VS Principal Pops Conductor Sean O’Loughlin leads the orchestra in an irresistible evening of joy, rhythm, and the eclectic musical styles, traditions and dances of...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
