    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;The evening you’ve been waiting for is finally here—half a decade later! Victoria’s iconic night of symphonic music returns to a floating barge in the Inner Harbour. Led by VS Principal Pops Conductor Sean O’Loughlin, this celebratory program features highlights from past SPLASH! events. From Tobin Stokes Inner Harbour Overture and Holst’s Jupiter from The Planets, to...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
