        "@value": "Tanya Tagaq in Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;A fearless innovator with a visceral stage presence and dizzyingly complex music, Tanya Tagaq is a Canadian cultural icon. The Inuk throat singer has spent her entire life championing her people, land, and culture while calling out oppressive systems and structures. With an extraordinary musical aesthetic, Tanya mines an artistic tradition dating back tens of...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
    ],
