      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Imagined within this multimedia project is an exploration of the many efforts around the world to bring voice to submerged histories. ECHO: Memories of the World highlights these important efforts through a unique fusion of music, video, spoken word, soundscape, and other artistic media. With a core team of Indigenous and non-Indigenous creators, this project not only...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
