        "@value": "E.T. The Extra-Terrestrial in Concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Director Steven Spielberg’s heart-warming masterpiece is one of the brightest stars in motion picture history. Filled with unparalleled magic and imagination, E.T. The Extra-Terrestrial follows the moving story of a lost little alien who befriends a 10-year-old boy named Elliott. Experience all the mystery and fun of their unforgettable adventure in the beloved movie that captivated...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
