    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Heino Eller’s Dawn captures both the first light of day and the awakening of Estonian national identity after World War I. Sibelius’s Violin Concerto, lyrical and vast, reflects the mystery of...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
