    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Elgar’s Introduction and Allegro was written in 1905 to showcase the virtuosity of the London Symphony Orchestra’s string players and its warmth and elegance remain irresistible today. Vaughan Williams’s beloved The...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
