    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Rossini’s mischievous Il signor Bruschino Overture sparkles with wit and charm—proof that classical can also be playful. Hayoung Choi, winner of the 2022 Queen Elisabeth Competition, brings brilliance and elegance to...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
