        "@value": "VS Presents: Valdés, Goodyear, &#038; VIS"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;We welcome some returning guests as VS presents a special concert by the Nanaimo-based Vancouver Island Symphony. Cuban-born Cosette Justo Valdés has won the hearts of musicians and audiences on Vancouver Island. Now in her third season as music director of VIS, she mates the madcap musical high jinks of Rossini alongside the happy spirits...&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
